  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"Standard\">Your companionship grows stronger the longer your pact persists. Your Domain Convocation aura increases to 30 feet. In addition, you gain a new feat to grow your convocator.</p><ul><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is an animal companion or similar, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.qgW8uHJXJGl3DKBS]{Incredible Companion (Druid)} feat (or an equivalent for a different type of companion).</p></li><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is a familiar, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Joy1e6pdqx6fN9mH]{Incredible Familiar} feat.</p></li><li><p class=\"Standard\">If your convocator is an eidolon, you gain an Evolution feat of up to 8th level.   </p></li></ul>"
    },
